  "conclusion": "The 250m minus 149.445m result is arithmetic, not one located missing segment. OSM has a three-arm bridge-tagged walkway junction: the 174.289m trunk and two distinct 76.9–78.1m branches. The Phase 2F main-way display also omits parts cut by the park boundary. North-to-south paths via either branch total about 251–252m, near the rounded 250m source value. This supports—but does not prove—a full route interpretation. The 186m engineering length remains definitionally unreconciled. No added bridge mesh is justified.",
